    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StA, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_0RB0LD_0RC1RC_1LD1RC_1LB1LA [SWin 1; SWinR 3; SCycL 2 0; SWin 5] (StA, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
