  apply (fire_of_run_instr tm Cc true true l B0_0RB0LD_1LC0RB_1LD1RC_0RC1LA p j [] []);
    [exact Hst | reflexivity | reflexivity | exact (gso_0RB0LD_1LC0RB_1LD1RC_0RC1LA p j E)].
Qed.


