    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StD, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_0RB0LD_1LC1RB_1LD1RC_0RB1LA [SCycL 2 0; SWin 4] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

