  - exists (6 * j + 10), (cden [] [] j BB1_0RB0LD_1LC1RD_0RD0LA_1LA1RB).
    split; [lia|]. split; [| exact (gbo_0RB0LD_1LC1RD_0RD0LA_1LA1RB j)].
    rewrite (gso_0RB0LD_1LC1RD_0RD0LA_1LA1RB p j E).
