    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StC, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_0RB0LD_1LC1RD_0RD0LA_1LA1RB [SWinR 2; SCycL 2 0; SWin 6] (StC, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
