Theorem nonhalt_0RB0LD_1RC0RB_1LA1RA_1LC0LA : NonHalt tm_0RB0LD_1RC0RB_1LA1RA_1LC0LA.
Proof. apply never_qh_tr_nonhalt, nqhtr_0RB0LD_1RC0RB_1LA1RA_1LC0LA. Qed.

