    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_0RB0LD_1RC0RC_1LD1RB_1LA1LA p j' E).
    + exact (geo_0RB0LD_1RC0RC_1LD1RB_1LA1LA p j' E).
    + lia.
